flowchart LR
  H[Height pixels] --> V[Vertices]
  V --> I[Triangle indices]
  V --> N[Normals]
  X[Optical image] --> U[UV coordinates + texture]
  I --> G[GLB / Three.js mesh]
  N --> G
  U --> G
  G --> C[Orbit / first-person camera]
  G --> R[Raycast click]
  R --> P[Pixel coordinate]
  P --> M[Relative or metric bilinear sample]
  M --> A[A/B elevation difference, distance, slope]

